        "description": "<p>When the Progress Countdown triggers, the party acquires the object of the Heist and must succeed on a group action roll to escape without capture. On a failure, each PC takes <strong>2d12</strong> direct physical damage and must mark a Stress.</p><section id=\"secret-KmJIVWWQQR4nBPRT\" class=\"secret\"><p>What makes getting out even more dangerous than getting in? What unforeseen developments stymie the party's original escape plan?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
